# 18. Lesson Completion

Users can click:

**Mark as Completed**

The backend stores:

```text
user_id
lesson_id
completed_at
```

Example:

```text
Completed Lessons
-----------------
10 / 25

Progress
40%
```

---

# 19. Progress Tracking

Basic progress formula:

```text
Progress =
Completed Lessons / Total Lessons × 100%
```

Example:

```text
10 / 20 × 100 = 50%
```

Progress should be displayed on:

* Dashboard.
* Course page.
* Lesson page.

---

# 20. Learning Path

This is one of the most important product features.

The platform should not simply become:

> "A website containing locked YouTube videos."

Instead, it should become:

> **A structured Arabic learning system.**

Example:

```text
LEVEL 1
Arabic Fundamentals
       ↓
LEVEL 2
Basic Nahwu
       ↓
LEVEL 3
Basic Shorof
       ↓
LEVEL 4
Arabic Text Reading
       ↓
LEVEL 5
Qur'anic Arabic Comprehension
```

This gives the product significantly more value than simply selling access to videos.

