Course Viewed
Checkout Started
Payment Successful
Course Started
Lesson Viewed
Lesson Completed
Course Completed
```

### Key Metrics

#### Conversion Rate

```text
Paid Users / Visitors
```

#### Course Completion Rate

```text
Users Completing Course /
Users Purchasing Course
```

#### Lesson Completion Rate

```text
Completed Lessons /
Total Lessons
```

---

# 34. Business Model

For the initial launch, a **one-time purchase per course** model is recommended because it is simpler to implement and easier for users to understand.

Example:

```text
Nahwu Fundamentals
Rp199,000

Shorof Fundamentals
Rp199,000

Nahwu + Shorof Bundle
Rp349,000
```

Later, a subscription model can be introduced.

Example:

```text
Rp99,000 / month
```

With:

```text
Access to All Courses
```

