# 38. User Roles

The MVP only needs two roles:

```text
STUDENT
ADMIN
```

## STUDENT

Can:

* Browse courses.
* Purchase courses.
* Access purchased courses.
* Watch lessons.
* Track learning progress.
* Manage their profile.

## ADMIN

Can:

* Manage courses.
* Manage modules.
* Manage lessons.
* Manage users.
* View transactions.
* View analytics.

